# Bullet NEXT Lab check mode (CL.11): reports the undefined-behaviour checker may skip.
# The legacy backend is Blender 2.79b's Bullet 2.84, frozen bit for bit (TL.2): its pair-cache
# hash shifts and adds signed ints that wrap, as every compiler it was ever built with does.
# Bullet NEXT has the upstream fix (unsigned hash); these lines only cover the frozen copy.
signed-integer-overflow:legacy/BulletCollision/BroadphaseCollision/btOverlappingPairCache.h
shift-base:legacy/BulletCollision/BroadphaseCollision/btOverlappingPairCache.h
signed-integer-overflow:legacy/BulletCollision/CollisionDispatch/btHashedSimplePairCache.h
shift-base:legacy/BulletCollision/CollisionDispatch/btHashedSimplePairCache.h
